  "independent_tests_passed": 7,
  "findings": [
    "R1 positive non-dispatch spend is rejected; per-model ordered reserved input/output must match dispatch numerical fields and sum<=8000. Known actual usage cannot exceed reservations.",
    "Seal scope is explicitly numerical/accounting consistency: it does not prove request digest identity. Full original request/receipt/recycler admission reconstruction remains mandatory in future runner/scorer.",
